# Unlocking a Myth: Warrior (jeuno 102): the trade, the weapon unworn. Accepted by a GM, a level 75 WAR with the
# SturdyAxe at 250 weapon skill points (xi.equipment.vigilWeaponRequiredWsPoints: 250) and a Bone Chip: the chip: nil
# (no message); the weapon: 10088 (1), finished: completed (no reward table), MYTHIC_LEARNED (1), King's Justice
# learned, the weapon kept. Completed: no section: 10085 (his default); a trade of the weapon: no section, nothing.
lists LowerJeuno/Zalsuhm/onTrigger LowerJeuno/Zalsuhm/onTrade LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/10088
char zone=LowerJeuno pos=-31.5,5.9,-117.5 job=WAR lvl=75
quest Jeuno.UnlockingAMythWarrior accepted
item SturdyAxe wsp=250
item BoneChip
login
trade Zalsuhm BoneChip x1               # not the weapon: nil
trade Zalsuhm SturdyAxe x1              # 250 >= 250: 10088 (1)
finish                                  # completed; MYTHIC_LEARNED (1); King's Justice; the weapon kept
trigger Zalsuhm                         # completed: no section; 10085
finish
trade Zalsuhm SturdyAxe x1              # completed: no section; nothing
